             141                     !      clough:  radiative transfer for inhomogeneous atmospheres: rrtm,    !
             142                     !      a validated correlated-k model for the longwave.  j. geophys. res., !
             143                     !      102, 16663-16682, 1997.                                             !
             144                     !                                                                          !
